                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game looks like cheap Geometry Dash rip-off, basically because it IS:\n\n-Visuals: Well cheap pixelated style - not THAT bad, but the problem is - every level has not bad background arts, at the same time every single level has horrible color palette - everything looks like a paint stain, because backgrounds, obstacles, and platforms are all the same color, this gives me a headache after a short game session.\n+Soundwork: The one and only good thing about this game - nice OST. Funny relaxing songs fitting the region you are trying to beat.\n-Gameplay: Everything is the same as in the geometry dash - you have levels to beat, you have hard to pick up special objects, you can customize your character if you grind enough coins (but why would you waste your time on this game on the 1st place?). Every level takes its place somewhere on the world map. That's all. \n-No steam achievements - no reason to waste your time here.\n+Steam cards - if you happen to get this game on sale you can cover the price with steam cards. Or you can simply buy this game anytime and refund it right away.\n\nDespite the low price, this game is a waste of time.\nhttp://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=835548531",
